# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in the real value.
#
#   Copy-Item .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored and must never be committed. In production the key is set with:
#
#   npx wrangler secret put NEBIUS_API_KEY
#
# Note: `.dev.vars` is a wrangler file. `npm run dev` runs a plain Node Vite server with no
# Workers runtime, so it does NOT read this file — see src/lib/server-env.ts. Scripts and the
# dev server read the key from the environment instead; the probe script parses this file
# directly as a convenience.

NEBIUS_API_KEY=

# Optional: global spend ceiling for local runs. Production values live under `vars` in
# wrangler.jsonc. Set any of them to 0 to stop all model calls and see cached verdicts.
# GLOBAL_VERDICT_LIMIT=5000
# GLOBAL_TOKEN_LIMIT=5000000
# GLOBAL_USD_LIMIT=15
